CREATED:20230714T024907Z
DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nEX Council\, Workflow\, Workbench\nSynopsis\n:\nImagi
	ne that the progress of customer requests can be tracked like a parcel fro
	m Amazon\, wouldn’t the customer and employee experience be seamless? To
	 realise this vision\, we are equipping the bank with Workflow Workbench b
	y having consolidating tasks from various systems into a single interface 
	to reduce toil and enable better collaboration.\nSpeaker\n:\nLinda Sim Pen
	g LEE\, Jitendra TEKCHANDANI\, Ee Lin TAN\nJoining Instructions\n(In-Perso
	n)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Marina Bay Financial Cen
	tre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\nJoining Instructions\n(via W
	ebex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\,
	 you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://
	dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq
	6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. Thi
	s will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal stre
	aming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: W
	ebex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e
	206605d89de4272e0e8da> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Addr
	ess and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Web
	ex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Me
	eting & Input Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \
	nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +85
	2-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +9
	1-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal c
	all-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362
	e0173666ba5856cc26881d5> \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230719T155000
